    "text": "By WNKY Staff ,\n8 hours ago LOGAN COUNTY, Ky. – The Logan County Detention Center (LCDC) is warning the public of a scam. According to a social media post, LCDC is aware of a scam targeting family members of incarcerated individuals. The scammers will call individuals posing as “Lieutenant Brown” working for LCDC. The scammers... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
